Corrected message:

Fix undo history items leaking a full-size copy of the layer

Raster, text, shape and rasterize-objects undo steps kept the
"before" surface copy alive after storing only a diff of it. The copy
is now freed when the diff is stored.

Also: undoing or redoing a mask edit on a layer whose mask no longer
exists now fails with an error instead of applying the mask's diff to
the layer's color pixels.

Adds surface-ownership tests for all four history item types.
